// Expected: changed
// Expected: once
// Expected: left borrowed
// Expected: 1
// Expected: left borrowed field
// Expected: borrowed
// Expected: alive source
// Expected: empty
// Expected: null left
// Expected: null left
// Expected: ABAB
// Expected: ABAB
// Expected: plain expressionplain expression
// Expected: fresh value
// Expected: loopx
